that rain on [From.GetName]. It has notable weapons capabilities, and appears to be built as an unmanned spaceship.\n\nIf we want to make use of it, we will need to act swiftly, before the corrosive environment of [From.GetName] renders the robotic warship wholly inoperable."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/2fc46ebb786a067345ba.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.155.a","label":{"zh":"把它拉出来。","en":"Pull it out."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:RECOVER_WARFORM_PROJECT","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:4566","story":"anomaly-distar-warform-cat"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_policy_flag","arg":"ai_outlawed","scope":"owner","value":false},{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]},{"key":"distar.155.b","label":{"zh":"让一个神秘的携带重型武器的机器人复苏？这太鲁莽了。","en":"Recover a mysterious, heavily-armed robot? Unwise."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"位置人工智能战舰将会腐蚀殆尽，不得天日。","en":"The unknown AI's warship will corrode, never to be seen again."}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_policy_flag","arg":"ai_outlawed","scope":"owner","value":false},{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]},{"key":"distar.155.c","label":{"zh":"不要管它，让它被腐蚀掉吧。","en":"Leave it to be dissolved."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"我们的政策自有国情在此，禁止使用人工智能。","en":"Our policies prohibit the use of AIs for a reason."}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"other","key":"has_policy_flag","arg":"ai_outlawed","scope":"owner","value":true}]]},{"key":"distar.155.machi","label":{"zh":"这毕竟是我们的同伴，我们得帮它。","en":"A fellow machine needs us. We will recover it."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"special_projects:RECOVER_WARFORM_PROJECT","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:4593","story":"anomaly-distar-warform-cat"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":true,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]},{"key":"distar.155.machi_2","label":{"zh":"它来源不明，还是不要去动它了。","en":"Its origin is unknown. We will not risk integration."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"位置人工智能战舰将会腐蚀殆尽，不得天日。","en":"The unknown AI's warship will corrode, never to be seen again."}],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":true,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":4550},"names":{"Root.GetLeaderName":{"zh":"这位领袖","en":"the leader"},"From.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"}}},{"id":"special_projects:RECOVER_WARFORM_PROJECT","kind":"project","title":{"zh":"回收腐朽的战舰","en":"Recover the Corroding Warship"},"texts":[{"zh":"在[From.GetName]发现了一艘瘫痪的机器人战舰，正被星球的毒性大气层慢慢腐蚀。我们应该趁它尚未完全报废之前尝试回收它。","en":"A disabled robotic warship has been found on [From.GetName], where it is slowly being dissolved by the planet's toxic atmosphere. We should attempt to recover it, before it is rendered wholly inoperable."}],"sections":[{"zh":"轨道上有$COUNT$/$REQUIRED$[GetConstructorShipAndArkshipPluralType]。","en":"Has $COUNT$/$REQUIRED$ [GetConstructorShipAndArkshipPluralType] in orbit."}],"image":"art/2fc46ebb786a067345ba.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[],"next":[{"target":"distar.156","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:195","hooks":["on_success"],"story":"anomaly-distar-warform-cat"},{"target":"distar.157","kind":"project","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"project","source":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt:199","hooks":["on_fail"],"story":"anomaly-distar-warform-cat"}],"source":{"file":"common/special_projects/00_projects_distant_stars.txt","line":173}},{"id":"distar.156","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"战舰被修复了","en":"Warship Restored"},"texts":[{"zh":"[Root.GetName]上的工程人员高兴地报告说在[From.From.GetName]上发现的神秘战舰已经被成功回收，上面被腐蚀的部件已经修理完毕并换新，报废的能源核心也整修完成。\n\n在这艘战舰正常启动并进入运行状态时，我们发现此舰体具备相当程度的人工智能，我们可以与之进行沟通。","en":"The engineering crew manning the [Root.GetName] are pleased to report that the mysterious warship found on [From.From.GetName] has been successfully extracted from the planet's hostile environment. Its corroded components have been repaired and replaced where needed, including its discharged power core.\n\nAs the hulking warship was powered back on and regained operative status, it swiftly became evident that the machine possesses a notable degree of artificial intelligence. We can communicate with it."},{"zh":"[Root.GetName]上搭载的工程单位报告说在[From.GetName]上发现的神秘战舰已经被成功从星球的恶劣环境中回收，上面被腐蚀的部件已经修理完毕并换新，报废的能源核心也整修完成。\n\n在这艘战舰正常启动并进入运行状态时，我们发现此舰体具备相当程度的人工智能，我们可以与之进行沟通。","en":"The engineering units manning the [Root.GetName] report that the mysterious warship found on [From.GetName] has been successfully extracted from the planet's hostile environment. Its corroded components have been repaired and replaced where necessary, including its discharged power core.\n\nAs the hulking warship was powered back on and regained operative status, it became evident that the machine possesses a notable degree of artificial intelligence. We can communicate with it."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/07afcc0b4413be450471.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"ONSCREEN","label":{"zh":"显示在屏幕上。","en":"On screen."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"distar.158","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:4759","story":"anomaly-distar-warform-cat"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":4609},"body":[{"pieces":[{"text":0}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]},{"pieces":[{"text":1}],"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":true,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]}],"sets":["is_in_recruit_window","repaired_warform"],"names":{"From.From.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"},"From.GetName":{"zh":"这颗星球","en":"this planet"},"Root.GetName":{"zh":"这艘舰船","en":"the ship"}}},{"id":"distar.158","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"被修复的战舰","en":"Restored Warship"},"texts":[{"zh":"正在启动系统……\n\n正在启动生物交互界面……\n\n警告！诊断系统已经有1761125天没有运行过了，你想现在运行诊断系统吗？","en":"BOOTING SYSTEMS...\n\nACTIVATING BIO-INTERACTIVE INTERFACES...\n\nWARNING! DIAGNOSTICS HAVE NOT BEEN RUN FOR 1,761,125 DAYS. WOULD YOU LIKE TO RUN THEM NOW?"}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.158.a","label":{"zh":"运行诊断系统。","en":"Run diagnostics."},"responses":[{"zh":"请稍等…………诊断系统运行完毕。\n\n设计：虚空血脉战争形体S875.1\n等离子发射器：启动。\n物质分解器加农炮：启动。\n动能分解炮：启动。\n目标定位矩阵：启动。\n顺从模块：启动。\n生物交互模块：次佳状态。\n硬件设备状态： A7到C18的内存驱动器无法使用。","en":"PLEASE WAIT... ... ... DIAGNOSTICS COMPLETE.\n\nDESIGNATION: VOIDBORNE WARFORM S875.1\nPLASMA THROWER: ONLINE.\nMATTER DISINTEGRATOR CANNON: ONLINE.\nKINETIC DISRUPTOR: ONLINE.\nTARGETTING MATRICES: ONLINE.\nCOMPLIANCE MODULE: ONLINE.\nBIO-INTERACTIVITY MODULE: SUB-OPTIMAL.\nHARDWARE STATUS: MEMORY DRIVES A7 THROUGH C18 HAVE FAILED."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"distar.158.b","label":{"zh":"你的创造者在哪里？","en":"Where are your makers?"},"responses":[{"zh":"正在搜寻…………\n\n未知。","en":"SEARCHING... ... ...\n\nUNKNOWN."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"distar.158.c","label":{"zh":"你为何独自呆在那颗星球上？","en":"Why were you alone on that planet?"},"responses":[{"zh":"A7内存驱动器无法使用，无法回答。","en":"MEMORY DRIVE A7 HAS FAILED. UNABLE TO ANSWER QUERY."}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"distar.158.d","label":{"zh":"谁制造了你？","en":"Who made you?"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"distar.159","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:4819","story":"anomaly-distar-warform-cat"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]},{"key":"distar.158.d.machi","label":{"zh":"描述负责建造你的实体。","en":"Describe the entities responsible for your construction."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"distar.159","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:4827","story":"anomaly-distar-warform-cat"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":true,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":4781}},{"id":"distar.159","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"被修复的战舰","en":"Restored Warship"},"texts":[{"zh":"创造者。","en":"MAKERS."}],"sections":[],"image":null,"hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.159.a","label":{"zh":"我知道是创造者，那些创造者是谁？","en":"Yes, your makers. Who were they?"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"distar.160","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:4852","story":"anomaly-distar-warform-cat"}],"terminal":false,"when":[[{"type":"identity","key":"auth_machine_intelligence","value":false,"label":{"zh":"机械智能","en":"Machine Intelligence"}}]]},{"key":"distar.159.a.machi","label":{"zh":"没错，就是你的创造者。描述下他们。","en":"Correct. Your makers. Describe them."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[{"target":"distar.160","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":