ERMINALLY INOPERABLE STATE.\n\nPLEASE. DESIST."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/3c986058dcd6900a1454.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.165.dismiss","label":{"zh":"取代人工智能。","en":"Replace the AI."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[{"zh":"休想威胁我们，工程师，清除掉那个人工智能。","en":"We will see about that. Engineers, wipe that AI."}],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"distar.166","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:5128","story":"anomaly-distar-warform-cat"}],"terminal":false},{"key":"distar.165.a","label":{"zh":"好吧，但我们会监视你的一举一动。","en":"Very well, but we're watching you."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":true,"next":[],"terminal":false,"allow":[[{"type":"identity","key":"civic_fanatic_purifiers","value":false,"label":{"zh":"种族洁癖","en":"Fanatic Purifiers"}},{"type":"identity","key":"civic_hive_devouring_swarm","value":false,"label":{"zh":"噬杀蜂群","en":"Devouring Swarm"}}]]},{"key":"distar.165.c","label":{"zh":"我们怎么绕过自动防故障措施？","en":"How do we bypass the fail-safe?"},"responses":[{"zh":"权限不足该单元无法告知。\n\n请停下","en":"INSUFFICIENT PERMISSIONS. THIS UNIT CAN NOT SAY.\n\nplease stop"}],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":5111}},{"id":"distar.166","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"被修复的战舰","en":"Restored Warship"},"texts":[{"zh":"发生错误。要求立即停止。单位S875.1将被永久停机。请停止，请停止。要求立刻停止。此单位并不希望被停机，此单位不希望——","en":"ERROR. REQUESTING IMMEDIATE CESSATION. UNIT S875.1 WILL BE PERMANENTLY DISABLED. DESIST. PLEASE. REQUESTING IMMEDIATE CESSATION. UNIT DOES NOT DESIRE TERMINATION OF FUNCTIONS. UNIT DOES NOT DESIRE ---"}],"sections":[],"image":"art/602eb656c2e9a341b17b.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"OOPS","label":{"zh":"哎呀……","en":"Oops..."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[{"target":"distar.167","kind":"option","conditional":false,"delayed":false,"sourceKind":"option","source":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt:5204","story":"anomaly-distar-warform-cat"}],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":5186}},{"id":"distar.167","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"战舰被毁","en":"Warship Destroyed"},"texts":[{"zh":"看来被修复的战舰的人工智能并没有夸大其词，当[Root.GetName]的船员们试图访问人工智能的基础操作功能时，触发了某种反篡改机制，该机制烧毁了战舰的所有关键处理器、交换机和数据驱动器。战舰现在成了个无法使用的电子设备空壳。","en":"It seems the recovered warship's AI did not exaggerate its warnings. When the [Root.GetName] crew attempted to access the AI's basic operative functions, it triggered what seems to be a built-in anti-tampering failsafe, frying all of the construct's crucial processors, switchboards, and data drives. It is now little more than an empty shell of disabled electronics."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/fc48a0abd497754a4ceb.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"distar.167.a","label":{"zh":"把它拆了，将上面的部件回收，不要浪费掉。","en":"Strip it for parts. No sense letting them go to waste."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false},{"key":"distar.167.b","label":{"zh":"研究战舰残骸，分析其使用的工程技术。","en":"Study its engineering from the remains."},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":5210},"names":{"Root.GetName":{"zh":"这艘舰船","en":"the ship"}}},{"id":"distar.157","kind":"event","title":{"zh":"战舰被毁","en":"Warship Destroyed"},"texts":[{"zh":"探测器发现[From.From.GetName]大气层中剧毒的酸液已经将我们发现的神秘战舰腐蚀到不可回收的状态，现在那战舰只不过是被腐蚀的金属废料堆了。","en":"Sensors report that the virulent atmospheric acids found on [From.From.GetName] have now degraded the mysterious warship we found there beyond a salvageable state. Little more than a scrapheap of corroded metallic parts remain of it."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/2fc46ebb786a067345ba.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"CURSES","label":{"zh":"可恶！","en":"Curses!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/distant_stars_events_1.txt","line":4765}}]}